{"title":"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> is randomly picked from inside the rectangle with  vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86f58cb609fa753024f1173510c877971f8e4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55cbad9e2ef9542b8d4d3d8c21f3c887fd44df2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be11a56a55425d6c6b69f70f5fa98eab95e8ad18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. What is the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4aee29876af28821f3a35178c09561adaf5a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/0/a30a03b6dc43679af3ca442123c383032d822bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{1}{8}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{3}{8}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"364\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rectangle has a width of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and a height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>The area of this rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a0362d563c30867dafad729983f553f9b2356a03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot1=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>The line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> intersects the rectangle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a465ffe5255961382f5777569608be052b783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>The area which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4aee29876af28821f3a35178c09561adaf5a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is the right isosceles triangle with side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that has vertices at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a465ffe5255961382f5777569608be052b783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be11a56a55425d6c6b69f70f5fa98eab95e8ad18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.  \n</p><p>The area of this triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbf674ec4ba523c1250f98c1f4789344349087ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot1^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p>Therefore, the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4aee29876af28821f3a35178c09561adaf5a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/220ebbdf7352bc97ca1fb9bbe5946fbae1eaa7e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{4}=\\frac{1}{8} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"138\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JueaMdaNRrs\">https://youtu.be/JueaMdaNRrs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WdpGXsAYxTQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WdpGXsAYxTQ</a>  ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;secti